# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Two clock formats stacked over a busy field, kept legible by a SCRIM: a
# black colour layer at 55 % behind the text dims the pattern without hiding
# it. The interference rings are ramped to one teal palette.
S - Date & Time
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Field
I @pat/interference
C sliderStyle 65536
R 100 0:00080c 120:0a5c6b 220:4fd1c5 255:e6fffb
L color 0 5 0 22 normal 55 none fill 1
N Scrim
L text 0 8 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Time
T clock HH:MM
F large ffffff c none 0
L text 0 19 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Date
T clock MM-DD
F tiny 9fd8ff c none 0
